                            <comment id="19863823" author="JIRAUSER182813" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 20:14:00 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=TVanDe17&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;TVanDe17&quot;&gt;Van den broeck, Tamara [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=CSims11&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;CSims11&quot;&gt;Sims, Cody [JRDUS]&lt;/a&gt; - Created On date shows in all the sheets in system audit trail report. In AC there is no mention of Created On. Please check whether to keep in report or update AC&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19863817" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 20:04:51 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=TVanDe17&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;TVanDe17&quot;&gt;Van den broeck, Tamara [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; Two more issues per Ankita&apos;s feedback:&lt;/p&gt;
