                            <comment id="19863805" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 19:57:59 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;Another issue per Ankita&apos;s feedback. For &quot;SO Properties&quot; tab, there are no additional filters and no &quot;Additional filter(s)&quot; listed in AC. For &quot;Security Policy&quot; tab there are no additional filters and &quot;Additional filter(s): N/A&quot; in the AC. The current implementation has &quot;Additional filter(s): N/A&quot; for both tabs. We need to either:&lt;/p&gt;
