                            <comment id="19862963" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 18:49:58 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=TVanDe17&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;TVanDe17&quot;&gt;Van den broeck, Tamara [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; A couple issues raised by Ankita for Notebook tab:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;AC for Resource Type is &quot;Resource Type: Notebook&quot; but this needs to be expanded because Experiments/GxP Experiments are also included. It should be &quot;Resource Type: Notebook, Experiment, GxP Experiment (Admin Defined Object)&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;AC for one of the Additional Filters is: &quot;For GxP Experiments: GxP Experiment&quot;, but this should be split into two as follows:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): For Experiments: Template is &apos;GxP-DEV General&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): For GxP Experiments: Template is &apos;GxP-GMP General&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="19853708" author="JIRAUSER211903" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 08:19:56 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=CSims11&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;CSims11&quot;&gt;Sims, Cody [JRDUS]&lt;/a&gt; updated the AC. I will take these settings up in the manual check. It was already reported to revvity that the resource type is missing for this action. However resolution from their end is missing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19852042" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2026 00:52:45 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=TVanDe17&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;TVanDe17&quot;&gt;Van den broeck, Tamara [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; I had to remove the following 2 Additional Filters on the System Settings tab:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Enabled users to edit first and last name (no resource type)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Disabled users to edit first and last name (no resource type)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The reason is that the Signals History Search API does not have a filter for &quot;typeless&quot; actions, meaning we either pass a Resource Type to search on, or leave it blank and get all results. I had implemented the latter solution, but have found in testing on DEV that this query returns hundreds of pages of results (roughly 26,700 results for one month) just to find the 2 rows where this setting changed. This is not viable in production, and so I had to remove these two filters.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Once the AC is updated, this is already deployed to TEST.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19661391" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Mon, 18 May 2026 23:12:37 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;URLs are:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.ui.eln-integrations.im.jnj.com/signals-system-audit-trail-download.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://dev.ui.eln-integrations.im.jnj.com/signals-system-audit-trail-download.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://test.ui.eln-integrations.im.jnj.com/signals-system-audit-trail-download.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://test.ui.eln-integrations.im.jnj.com/signals-system-audit-trail-download.html&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19634856" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Fri, 15 May 2026 00:49:29 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Old Value / New Value column coverage&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tabs with both Old Value and New Value&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Notebook&lt;/em&gt;: Old Value = source path (move events), New Value = destination path&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Attributes&lt;/em&gt;: Old Value = previous field value (diffed from revision snapshots), New Value = new field value&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;System Group&lt;/em&gt;: Old Value = removed member / dissociated tag, New Value = added member / associated tag&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Templates&lt;/em&gt;: Old Value = previous Name or Description (when those fields change), New Value = new Name or Description; shows &quot;Content: Modified&quot; in New Value when only template content changes (no old value in that case)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tabs with New Value only &#8212; Old Value column omitted from report&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These tabs only surface the new/current state because a before-value is not available from the API payloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;ADO&lt;/em&gt;: workflow configuration changes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;External Action&lt;/em&gt;: connector configuration changes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Data Source&lt;/em&gt;: connector configuration changes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Materials Definition&lt;/em&gt;: material definition snapshot (name + field list)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Roles&lt;/em&gt;: privilege list snapshot&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;SO Properties&lt;/em&gt;: property definition snapshot (type, measure unit, mandatory flag)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Security Policy&lt;/em&gt;: policy source snapshot&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;System Settings&lt;/em&gt;: connector / workflow settings&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Global Numbering&lt;/em&gt;: numbering settings (enabled flag, start number)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Known limitations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Templates content diff not available. Content-only changes are reported as &quot;Content: Modified&quot; with no diff detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="19615484" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Wed, 13 May 2026 16:28:19 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/6855563/6855563_Demo+JGVT-2269+JGVT-2569.mov&quot; title=&quot;Demo JGVT-2269 JGVT-2569.mov attached to JGVT-2569&quot;&gt;Demo JGVT-2269 JGVT-2569.mov&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
