                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1) Access and download rights web user interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user has an active signals account&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the signals user accesses the web user interface&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the web user interface shows the details as described in &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2269&quot; title=&quot;Reports_Audit Trail: System Audit Trail- Ad hoc report generation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-2269&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-2269&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2) Download available on web user interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the system audit trail report is generated for the requested period (month-year)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the signals user accesses the web user interface, enters t&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;he requested period (month-year) and&lt;/font&gt; clicks the search button&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the excel download button is active in the web user interface&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3) Message when no report is available&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the web user interface shows SAT report period (month-year) search fields, a search button and an excel download button&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the user enters a period (month-year) and&lt;/font&gt;&#160;clicks the search button and the audit trail report is still in progress or not yet requested&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; a message is displayed to inform the user &quot;The System audit trail report is not yet requested or is being generated.&quot;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4) Downloaded Excel System audit trail report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Excel Audit trail report&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; a Signals active session&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the User requests the system audit trail via the external action (manual (&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2269&quot; title=&quot;Reports_Audit Trail: System Audit Trail- Ad hoc report generation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-2269&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-2269&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;))&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the system shall extract the audit log data as per filters defined below and generate a excel report with the following details and store it on the AWS S3 GxP qualified storage to be available for download request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A) The excel contains multiple sheets and filters per sheet (&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Top rows content)&lt;/font&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Notebook&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type : Notebook&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Moved/Transferred, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): &apos;For Notebooks: Department is &apos;Synthetics Development-GxP&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): For Experiments: Template is &apos;GxP-DEV General&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): For GxP Experiments: Template is &apos;GxP-GMP General&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Attributes&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Ressource Type : SNConfig: Attribute&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : Name:&quot;Variant Name in Variations Table&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : Name:contains&quot;GxP&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;ADO&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Ressource Type:Admin Defined Object Definition, SNConfig: System Admin Defined Object Template&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Edited&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : &apos;GxP-GMP General Template (SNConfig: System Admin Defined Object Template)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : &apos;Updated workflow for &quot;GxP Request&quot; workflow &#160;(SNConfig: Admin Defined Object Definition)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : &apos;Updated workflow for &quot;GxP Experiment&quot; workflow (SNConfig: Admin Defined Object Definition) &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;External Action&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Ressource Type : SNConfig: External Action&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : Name:contains&quot;GxP&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Data Source&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: External Data Source, SNConfig: Internal Data Source&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name:contains&quot;GxP&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;System Group&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Group Associations, SNConfig: System Groups&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Created, Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): System group name: contains &quot;GxP (SNConfig: Group Associations)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): User ID is different from service account (SNConfig: System Groups)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Materials Definition&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Materials Definition, Container Type&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;From date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;first day of selected month&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;To date: &#160; &#160;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;last day of selected month or current date when month is not finished&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : Material Name: contains&quot;GxP&quot; (SNConfig: Materials Definition)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s) : Container type name : contains &quot;GxP&quot; (Container Type) &#160; &#160; &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Roles&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Roles&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s) : Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name: &apos;Standard User&apos;&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name: &apos;Janssen Internal User&apos;&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name: &apos;GxP Std User&apos;&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name: &apos;GxP Superuser&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;SO Properties&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Sample/Task properties&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Created, Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Additional filter(s): N/A&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Security Policy&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Security Policy&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): N/A&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Templates&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: SNConfig: Worksheet Template, SNConfig: System Sample Template, SNConfig: Table Template, SNConfig: System Experiment Template&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited, Deleted/Trashed&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Name: contains&quot;GxP&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;System Settings&lt;/font&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: System Settings, System Settings: Timeout&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Deletion (System Settings)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Workflow settings (System Settings)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Session Timeout &#160;(System Settings: Timeout)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): AI feature (System Settings)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Global Numbering
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Resource Type: System Settings: Global Numbering&lt;br/&gt;
From date : eg 01-JUN-2026&lt;br/&gt;
To date : eg 30-JUN-2026 (or current date)&lt;br/&gt;
Action(s): Edited&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Notebook (System Settings: Global Numbering)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): GxP Request (System Settings: Global Numbering)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): GxP Experiment (System Settings: Global Numbering)&lt;br/&gt;
Additional filter(s): Sample (System Settings: Global Numbering)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;B) Table (excel table format) with the following columns (column header are defined between &quot;&quot;):&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Date/Time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Resource Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Change Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value) - only applicable for Notebook, Attributes, System Group, Templates&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value) - applicable for Notebook, Attributes, System Group, Templates (Content-only changes are reported as &quot;Content: Modified&quot;), ADO, External Action, Data Source, Materials Definition, &#160;Roles, SO Properties, Security Policy, System Settings, Global Numbering&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;E)&lt;/font&gt;&#160;the downloaded excel file will have filename composed of the following components:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;SAT-MMM-YYYY_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+ x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.xlsx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
